    of the video game industry, commited to providing experiences,\n \"Made by Gamers
    for Gamers\xAE\".\n\nThis applicaton form is designed to help us make sure you
    are the \nright fit for the position. No resume is required because we believe
    you learn \nbest on the job. Please take your time and answer all the questions
    \nwith the utmost honesty, for your safety. Good luck!"
